# Phase 3.5 (collaborative canvas) — David's own anonymous-auth uid, so the
# RTDB rules and the app's own moderation UI can both grant him delete
# rights on anything, not just his own stuff. See CANVAS_REBUILD.md's
# "Phase 3.5 design" section for how to get this value. Safe to be public
# (it's not a secret, just an identifier — the rules are what actually gate
# anything), but has no effect until it's set to a real uid.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CANVAS_OWNER_UID=
